Domain Entity ClassPeriod
    documentation 'This entity represents the designation of a regularly scheduled series of class 
                  'meetings at designated times and days of the week.
    allow primary key updates
    reference School
        documentation 'Relates the ClassPeriod to the school.
        is part of identity
    string ClassPeriodName
        documentation 'An indication of the portion of a typical daily session in which students 
                      'receive instruction in a specified subject (e.g., morning, sixth period, block 
                      'period, or AB schedules). 
        is part of identity
        min length 1
        max length 20